  #line-at(85.104pt, 648.34pt, "spectrum (grey), are shown in Fig. 2c. The reconstruction used a 1 ms acquisition time ")
  #line-at(85.104pt, 675.94pt, "and achieved a 30 MHz (or 0.24 pm) spectral resolution. A zoom-in view further ")
  #line-at(85.104pt, 703.54pt, "highlights the finely resolved noisy spectral characteristics. These results demonstrate the ")
